<h3><u>Alam abbas ka</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Alam abbas ka</u></strong></p>

<p>Al Qama bata</p>

<p>Ay al Qama bata</p>

<p>Ay Karbala bata, Ay al Qama bata</p>

<p>Tanha Hussain dekh, rahe the ye majra</p>

<p>Aya tha kis tarha say, tarai me ba wafa</p>

<p>Or kis tarha se khun may tar ho kai reh gaya</p>

<p>(Alam abbas ka, alam abbas ka) x2</p>

<ol>
 <li>Ye wo alam hai jis say, shahidon ki shaan hai Qurbanion ka naam, wafaa ka nishan hai Bachon ki abroo hai, Sakina ki jaan hai
 <p>(Alam abbas ka, alam abbas ka) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>lehra raha hai iska pharera hawaon mai iski bulandyo ka hai charcha fizaon mai sab karbala hai iskai phareray ki chaon mai
 <p>(Alam abbas ka, alam abbas ka) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>phaila huwa iska jo saya Hussain tak rasta isi ne sub ko dikhaya hussain tak hur bhi isi ko dekh kar aya hussain tak
 <p>(Alam abbas ka, alam abbas ka) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>piyaso ka is alam may safina bhi dekhiye panjay mai roshni ka khazina bhi dekhiya lipti hui hai mashk-e-sakina bhi dekhiye
 <p>(Alam abbas ka, alam abbas ka) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>dekh is alam kay saye mai yakja hai kon kon qasim hai baheb-e-kalbiyo Aabis Umairo oun akbar say khoob ruke barabar kharain hain john
 <p>(Alam abbas ka, alam abbas ka) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>ghazi kai khun sai jo mili hai baqa isay hazir ye iftikhar rahay ga sada isay har dor main uthayengay ahle-e-aza isay
 <p>(Alam abbas ka, alam abbas ka) x2</p>

 <p>bete bichar gaye hain ye dil ko malal hai lakin bahan ko bhai kai haq ka sawal hai zainab ko har dua mai isi ka khayal hai</p>

 <p>(Alam abbas ka, alam abbas ka) x2</p>
 </li>
 <li>ay tashnalab wafao kay darya salam lai har apne soghwar ka piyasa salam lai ay karbala kai dast-e-guridan salam lai</li>
</ol>

<p>(Alam abbas ka, alam abbas ka) x2</p>
